  "notes": "12-step yellow scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: yellowA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/yellow.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/yellow-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --yellow-1: #fdfdf9;\n  --yellow-2: #fefce9;\n  --yellow-3: #fffab8;\n  --yellow-4: #fff394;\n  --yellow-5: #ffe770;\n  --yellow-6: #f3d768;\n  --yellow-7: #e4c767;\n  --yellow-8: #d5ae39;\n  --yellow-9: #ffe629;\n  --yellow-10: #ffdc00;\n  --yellow-11: #9e6c00;\n  --yellow-12: #473b1f;\n}\n.dark {\n  --yellow-1: #14120b;\n  --yellow-2: #1b180f;\n  --yellow-3: #2d2305;\n  --yellow-4: #362b00;\n  --yellow-5: #433500;\n  --yellow-6: #524202;\n  --yellow-7: #665417;\n  --yellow-8: #836a21;\n  --yellow-9: #ffe629;\n  --yellow-10: #ffff57;\n  --yellow-11: #f5e147;\n  --yellow-12: #f6eeb4;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix yellow</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fdfdf9\" title=\"--yellow-1: #fdfdf9\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#fefce9\" title=\"--yellow-2: #fefce9\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#fffab8\" title=\"--yellow-3: #fffab8\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#fff394\" title=\"--yellow-4: #fff394\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffe770\" title=\"--yellow-5: #ffe770\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#f3d768\" title=\"--yellow-6: #f3d768\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#e4c767\" title=\"--yellow-7: #e4c767\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#d5ae39\" title=\"--yellow-8: #d5ae39\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffe629\" title=\"--yellow-9: #ffe629\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffdc00\" title=\"--yellow-10: #ffdc00\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#9e6c00\" title=\"--yellow-11: #9e6c00\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#473b1f\" title=\"--yellow-12: #473b1f\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#14120b\" title=\"--yellow-1: #14120b\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#1b180f\" title=\"--yellow-2: #1b180f\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#2d2305\" title=\"--yellow-3: #2d2305\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#362b00\" title=\"--yellow-4: #362b00\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#433500\" title=\"--yellow-5: #433500\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#524202\" title=\"--yellow-6: #524202\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#665417\" title=\"--yellow-7: #665417\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#836a21\" title=\"--yellow-8: #836a21\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffe629\" title=\"--yellow-9: #ffe629\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#ffff57\" title=\"--yellow-10: #ffff57\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#f5e147\" title=\"--yellow-11: #f5e147\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#f6eeb4\" title=\"--yellow-12: #f6eeb4\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
